    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b583a99189f78171f5da960",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱斯莱斯是在自主训练时间完成最后调整的吗——最终，\n训练员们没能看到她的赛前训练，就迎来了选拔赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a1009e8937f20d63a43fc03e58a61c62b85300a014bfd0829e5b9b8f178ca8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ec4ff42dcb8f539b38f2521",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对琵琶晨光、胜利奖券、成田大进她们，\n她会展现出怎样的跑法呢。选拔赛终于开始了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "079295ba70e5aa223094e5313b51b0328b7185341a7fd1619ee7071ef41d9d7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:093536ca0d06e1eaeb2f70d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱斯莱斯在中盘之前都占据着不错的位置，\n但终盘被拉开距离，最终以第4名完赛……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83980adbb77fe81a2ada5fbd11bf216219eaf0eca1b1ea539ef2dbd6ca0df03e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2f53d20e6580cced764cf11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员们",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3ccd8ed8afca8f2c412cc8040e9e3cd8214241c3b8d1e1a93ba7443f8f1e142",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8dd160c4e129bc950ed05c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『胜利奖券，要不要和我一起以德比为目标？』\n『成田大进，谈谈吧！』『琵琶晨光，可以占用一点时间吗？』",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dd974d95f4882111a05f75935174aa66fc752b6ae91e95e7db59cad84fdd295",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103003.json",
