    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc22b157efbdaa46c93bd84c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱斯莱斯也不差，不过……赛前那一出啊。\n从性格上看，感觉会有些难办。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3c0cc8d4e26e110cbb383cd673440e1eacd278d919ded618dd639b6128ca806",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b186e16c3ee0ac38237f830f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（莱斯她到底是怎么想的……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d76976b36a21a3fd06a08a2ce82c4d20e5000dba529419d7465095a80b11f06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b961abc79ffc8a5160edbcf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果没有结果相伴，赛前训练不公开\n被看成单纯的表演也是无可奈何。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be4bf44b6a7686004ce76a0db979b2b35f7b3c4434154c4e5e67fe0be273a83d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd5c7caed14826bea7845d27",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在意的是她走向地下马道时那认真的神情。\n那份庄重与哗众取宠的行动截然相反，让我心里不安……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e773a1aa3b86e3870e96500cb3c3e7f03d36c54e5820fa83dd50d43e3157f982",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1103/storytimeline_041103003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44cc2bf313feb72ff9605698",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为什么……要不公开赛前训练？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f058268f560f649137f475ce21bbf9f2b4bd9eb2f57aa0d149766637b9f0d5a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
