      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯。首先要让训练员先生们对我产生兴趣。\n然后再让他们评价我的跑法。这是必要的第一步吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "954a1bde6e772f87ae51bd9a522e76edd32017f5b33451d74e62b832d1c10670",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
