      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，无论是赛前训练不公开，还是之前的接触。\n她的自我包装，结果都适得其反了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "136c75dd06abaf69113d2bd3b2d9d6f67971505bf5d4bd94b21e091f1d8f8e52",
